us locatifs. Le bail commercial assure le versement des loyers, que le logement soit occupé ou non.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter Acumen Patrimoine :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\n\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"Plateau de Bonascre","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjBjYjA2NDkxMTM1YzQ5ZGNlODgxZmRiNjQ0ZDRkMTBhNzM3OGJmMjYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI3NzYzNGVjY2MzZmU1MWY0NmU4Nzc4ZjJlYmIwNmVhNCJ9?signature=3a000138812dd3a6b814ae9351769157c6b726ad29a01613b15d88af9c349f50","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImMzODMyNGU3NjdlMmNkYzE1ZWJkM2I0ZjZiNWEzYjk3NDMzNGJkMjEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI5NDIyZTA0ODgxYTFlNWEyMGYxNGFmMGI5NTU1ZDhmZCJ9?signature=8d122b37d2c1d642cf35510123cc64b7a50d9220a03eb10c2e34b14f06f6b84b","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjYyMWZiY2VjOWRhMzhhNzA0YjcwNmJhNGUxZGU5MTcwMWZiMGE5N2IiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJlNmE4M2EzNjRmMjU2Y2NjMmZiNmExNDZhODM4OThmYiJ9?signature=cce7642cd6ac81acaf97fa14f3ffdfba3b78e538b838b38f0523e48b9a311f9d","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImM1ZTQzMWVhM2ZlZTAzZTA1MGZmNzdhYzIxZjdlY2JlNWZlMmRjOWUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI4MjI3NDQyOWY2OWUwMTQzMDU1YzVkNmFlMDUwZDAxNCJ9?signature=715584a261d515fad55c21adfc94ea91c7e2d52db6cf1611ef5f8206d80ac0af","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjI3ZDg4Mzg4NzM4OTM3MDllZDZlYzUxN2Y0YzFjNjg2ZWM4ODMzZDIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lk